# Add this block to .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature.yml (under `body:`).
# When checked, the Lead runs Mia (PM framing) before Sam's plan in /lgtmgate:feature.
# YAML — keep 2-space indentation consistent with the surrounding `body:` list.

  - type: checkboxes
    id: pm_review
    attributes:
      label: PM review (Mia)
      description: Check to ask Mia to propose / refine acceptance criteria and success metrics (analytics events) before Sam's plan.
      options:
        - label: Ask Mia to frame this feature (acceptance criteria + success metrics)
